~ intro_bedroom
Caleb: "My name is Caleb." 
Caleb: "I'm a tech student at WVSU."
Caleb: "I came here chasing the future I dreamed of."
=> END

~ hallway_thoughts
Caleb: "I've walked through this hallway hundreds of times..."
Caleb: "...but I've never really looked around."
=> END

~ faculty_dash_warning
Caleb: "Professor?!"
=> END

~ cat_encounter
Caleb: "What is this cat up to..."
- Follow the cat.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "follow_cat"})
	Mango: "Meow"
	Caleb: "You're responsible for that paper situation up there, aren't you?"
	Mango: "Meow"
- Resist the urge.
	Everyready: "Meow!"
	Caleb: "You made that mess, didn't you?"
=> END

~ faculty_intro
Faculty: "Caleb, you're just in time."
Faculty: "I need help sorting these books before class."
- Offer to help.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "help_faculty"})
	Caleb: "Of course, Professor. I can help."
	Faculty: "Thank you. Follow me."
- Say you're busy.
	Caleb: "Sorry, Professor. I can't help right now."
	Faculty: "That's alright. Be careful in the hallway."
=> END

~ faculty_escort_pause
Faculty: "Just put those books on the table."
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "faculty_cultural_echo_start"})
do wait(5)
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "faculty_pause_sound_stop"})
Caleb: "Did you hear that?"
Faculty: "Hear what, Caleb?"
Caleb: "Nothing ... never mind, Prof."
Faculty: "Feel free to check the books,I can lend them to you if you want."
Faculty: "It’s my way of thanking you for your help."
=> END

~ faculty_leave
Faculty: "I'll leave you to it, Caleb."
Faculty: "Take your time with the books."
Caleb: "Thank you, Prof."
=> END

~ bookshelf_papers_intro
Caleb: "That sound again..." 
Caleb: "Wait. Is that trash on the bookshelf?"
Caleb: "I should remove them while I'm here."
=> END

~ paper_minigame_start
Caleb: "Why are these papers scattered all over the floor?"
Caleb: "They have letters written on them..."
Caleb: "Maybe they mean something."
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "start_minigame"})
=> END

~ paper_minigame_success
Caleb: "Persevere..."
Caleb: "Huh, I wonder who left those there. Well, Some things around the university carry stories."
=> END

~ office_post_minigame_choice
Caleb: "I should decide whether to keep looking around or head out."
- Leave the office.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "office_leave"})
- Stay in the office.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "office_stay"})
	Caleb: "I'll keep scanning the office."
=> END

~ follow_cat_exit_choices
Caleb: "Where will you take me? Are there more stories waiting outside these halls?"
- Stay.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "stay_in_level1"})
	Caleb: "I need to think for a bit."
- Follow further.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "proceed_to_level2"})
=> END


~ resist_urge_exit_choices
Caleb: "I should get going. The journey isn't over yet."
- Stay.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "stay_in_level1"})
	Caleb: "I need to think for a bit."
- Leave Queston Hall.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "proceed_to_level2"})
=> END

~ go_down_queston_hall
Caleb: "Maybe I should head downstairs to clear my mind."
=> END

~ go_up_queston_hall
Caleb: "Maybe I should head back upstairs."
=> END

~ cat_first_see
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "level1_cat_cultural_echo_start"})
Caleb: "Is that a cat?"
=> END

~ cant_go_there
Caleb: "Oh, nothing to see here."
=> END

# New Dialogue for Level 2: Calle Real (Caleb and Eveready only)

~ calle_real_initial_entry_cat
Caleb: "Woah... it's a lot. The noise, the people... I can barely think."
Mango: "Keep your head up, kid. "
Caleb: "Woah, what? When did this cat changed colors?"
=> END

~ calle_real_initial_entry
Caleb: "Hmm. This is weird."
Caleb: "This place is usually bustling with people. Why is there only one stall left open?"
=> END

~ calle_real_street_vehicles_cat
Caleb: "Tricycles, jeepneys... they're everywhere. Zipping past, horns blaring."
Mango: "Meow"
Caleb: "Hmm. I've passed through this place before."
Caleb: "That's weird though. This place is usually bustling with people. Why is there only one stall left open?"
Mango: "Meow"
Caleb: "Look, there's a vendor. Lets ask him."
=> END

~ puzzle_intro
Caleb: "Why are these old photos scattered all over the floor?"
Caleb: "One of them is torn apart."
Caleb: "Wait, that sound . . why is it getting stronger . ."
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "start_minigame"})
=> END

~ puzzle_table_intro
Caleb: "One of these photos is torn apart."
Caleb: "Wait, that sound is getting stronger . ."
do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "start_minigame"})
=> END!


~ calle_real_vendor_intro
Vendor: "Welcome to Calle Real."
Caleb: "Thanks."
Vendor: "I've laid out some local items on the table."
Vendor: "Why don't you take a closer look?"
Vendor: "See if anything catches your eye.

- Look around some more.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "accept_vendor_offer"})
- Leave.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "explore_calle_real"})
	Caleb: "I'll take a look around first."
	Vendor: "Take your time. Explore the beauty of calle real."
=> END

~ calle_real_vendor_choice
Vendor: "Look around some more or leave?"
- Look around some more.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "accept_vendor_offer"})
- Leave.
	do DialogueManager.mutated.emit({"mutation": "explore_calle_real"})
=> END

~ calle_real_balcony_arrival
Caleb: Funny. On the first floor, it's almost completely empty, yet the traffic outside is so loud you can barely think.
Caleb: But looking at the whole picture from up here...
Caleb: You realize how peaceful it is to just step away from the noise.
=> END
